%% M9 sequence: the notification bell lists and marks notifications.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Signed-in user
    participant W as Next.js BFF
    participant G as api-gateway
    participant NS as notification-service
    participant DB as MongoDB notifications
    U->>W: open the bell
    W->>G: GET /api/v1/notifications/me?page=0&size=20
    G->>NS: forward (JWT valid)
    NS->>DB: find by userId, newest first
    DB-->>NS: page of notifications
    NS-->>W: 200 items and unread count
    U->>W: click a notification
    W->>G: POST /api/v1/notifications/me/{id}/read
    G->>NS: forward
    NS->>DB: set read = true where id and userId match
    NS-->>W: 204, badge count drops
